<section class="hero approved-hero"><div class="public-container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Your campus. Better organized.</p><h1>Everything important,<br>right where <span>students</span> need it.</h1><p class="hero-lead">Announcements, deadlines, notifications and discussions — organized around your semester, section and student community.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="public-button" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/register">Get Started <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="public-button secondary" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/login">Sign In <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><p class="hero-note">Built for university students and Class Representatives.</p></div>
