<section class="why-section"><div class="public-container why-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Why StudentHub?</p><h2>Important information shouldn't disappear inside hundreds of chat messages.</h2><p>Messages move fast. Important updates get buried. Deadlines get missed.</p><p>StudentHub keeps everything organized and easy to find.</p></div><div class="reason-list"><article><span>01</span><strong>Know what matters</strong></article><article><span>02</span><strong>Know when it's due</strong></article><article><span>03</span><strong>Know where to discuss it</strong></article></div></div></section>
